{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_pianst_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_pianst_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"陽光灑落之前","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_pianst_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"ef98f25a083787b205f20ea17755c15d7010a77ebcb72a6cae693dfb81e7d407","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g1_gorgeousstreets"},{"type":"narration","text":"“還有力氣嗎？我們再繞著夕照區走一圈？”\n“……”\n“哈哈，你終於肯承認體力比我差了？”\n“太陽快下山了，夜裡的風……很冷。”\n“我知道，我都知道。”\n眼前的人虛弱地笑著，那張蒼白的臉卻被夕陽鍍成金色的。\n“可是我就是要一直走到太陽下山，從清晨走到黃昏。”\n“我要把養育我二十年，也囚禁我二十年的這片天地的樣子，深深記在心裡……”\n“在我還能唾棄它、歌頌它、憎恨它、眷戀它的時候。”\n“因為我知道，不管是我，還是我的音樂，都再也不可能走出這小小的夕照區了。”\n“答應我，不要像我一樣，不要在這件事上輸給我……好嗎？”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你眼眶紅紅的。剛經過夕照廳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"節哀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝關心，斯特羅洛——抱歉，是格特魯德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，本來就沒有幾個人知道我這些小小的偏好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就連侍從們也不習慣用名字叫他們的領主。說到底，時間太短，我和這座城市、這座高塔相互都還不太熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話又說回來，真是不好意思，讓你特地跑來。今天所有人都在忙，只好讓你到高庭區來一趟……拿去，你的藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高塔的守衛沒有為難你吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打算為難，但是在看到你的字條之後就嘀咕著“大逆不道”之類的話，然後就退到旁邊去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，這座高塔跟我還不只是不熟悉，我和它還有得吵呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說，《晨暮》的樂譜上有車爾尼的署字，還傳出了維謝海姆，這不比一個兩個感染者闖進高庭區來得更大逆不道嗎？所以別太在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（苦笑）在意？平民和感染者，我都不是第一天當了……反而是像你這樣的貴族實在是太少了。我得再次謝謝你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要忙著謝我，我也不只是叫你來拿藥而已，還想要請你幫我一個忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要是我能做到的，你儘管說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望你能在我哥哥的葬禮上為他演奏一曲《晨暮》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道這個有點強人所難，除了需要把長笛和大提琴的二重奏改成鋼琴獨奏之外……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我懂，他和你沒有任何關係，唯一的關係就只有領主與人民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他……怎麼說呢，他不是我父親那樣的強硬領主，他是個搖擺不定的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，很軟弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但也因為他軟弱到幾乎一無是處，跟父親比起來，他也算是比較無害，不管是對我，還是對他的人民——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格特魯德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不用這麼刻意去貶低他。我知道失去重要的人的感受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛還去看了老師。她和你現在一樣，一聊起自己的女兒就沒什麼好話，說她倔強，說她不聽話，說她沒福氣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是說到最後，她都會泣不成聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"脆弱就是脆弱，假裝責備逝者也掩蓋不了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我也得說清楚，伯爵的葬禮一定會有很多貴族出席。你做事又總是一石二鳥，我猜……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，你的贊助人會邀請很多音樂評論家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的名聲確實已經傳開了，但還不夠……我說簡單一點吧，還差得遠。我們必須把握每一次能讓你出名的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是你哥哥的葬禮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這是一場私人悼念，我會很樂意演奏《晨暮》，但在那些驕傲自大的貴族，和目中無人的評論家面前……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你才是那個需要被安慰的人，格特魯德。不是他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你不喜歡這樣。你對音樂永遠都那麼純粹，但我不是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得無關緊要的東西，錢、名望、人脈……我不能不管。藝術家可以做到絕對的純粹，但贊助人不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格特魯德……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再想想吧，好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g5_czernyhome"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，吃飯啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏爾蘇拉，我知道了，不要叫這麼大聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你一直在等我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，你怎麼了？你心情才好起來沒兩天……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格特魯德那邊……有一個請求，他希望我在她兄長的葬禮上演奏《晨暮》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這有什麼好猶豫的，她不是你的贊助人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……可是那是一位貴族的公開葬禮啊，烏爾蘇拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對我而言，演奏《晨暮》……就好像撥開自己的外殼，把最脆弱的部分……展現給別人，期待他們的理解，期待他們的共鳴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如是為你、為格特魯德，甚至為夕照區的隨便哪位鄰居奏響這首樂曲，我都會心甘情願。因為我知道你們會了解我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但那些貴族，那些評論家……他們能了解什麼？技術的巧妙，還是像我看到過的一篇評論《晨暮》的奇文……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“作者卑微的身分和他的音樂野心反差強烈到不成正比”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我為什麼要在那些人面前揭開自己脆弱的一面？就為了名聲？為了錢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，先生，你先不要生氣，我們先吃飯，好不好？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殘黨的活動報告、私人武裝的集結點……唉，我的好哥哥啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯特羅洛女士——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在做什麼？那些——那些不是重要的機密文件嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以更應該到壁爐裡待著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有你，拉赫曼，“術師先生”把你派到維謝海姆來已經好幾年了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……您？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要擔心，“術師先生”以前是我父親的上級，後來是我哥哥的上級，現在則是我的。我並沒有打算改變這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……感謝您的寬容，斯——不，格特魯德女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在做下一步之前，我們還得把葬禮辦好。你覺得還缺什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您明知故問了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能出席一位伯爵的葬禮，您邀請的評論家們都受寵若驚。但如果音樂家本人不到場……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是個傻瓜，傻到對唾手可得的名利不屑一顧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是因為他是個傻瓜，《晨暮》的作者才是想著范妮的他，而不是想著親愛的哥哥的我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您真的想把這種重情的人牢牢控制在自己掌心，或許您應該想辦法在私人關係上更進一步……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要出餿主意了，他對我沒那個意思。讓他覺得我是個慷慨的贊助人，是他好友中最值得依靠的那個，這樣就夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是這樣的話……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得萬一他不來，我的努力就全白費了，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他會來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您還有留一手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有什麼留一手，我只是了解他而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者說，他只是太單純了，單純到稍微接觸一下，就一眼看透他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g5_czernyhome"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼叫“在那之前你吃飯都是不等我的”，我一直都會等先生吃飯好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還記得呢，有一次范妮找我，說我的對位法練習題做錯了，我就放下碗衝出去，在老師家跟范妮一直吵到半夜……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果餓著肚子回家時，桌子上乾乾淨淨，什麼都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也沒想到那天她們剛好沒煮晚飯。再說，我不是做了宵夜送到范妮家去了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……范妮還燙到舌頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還說人家，你自己不是也差點把烤馬鈴薯掉到地上？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"馬鈴薯湯還是溫的，再來一碗吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰啊？門沒鎖，進來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎歡迎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃攤主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏爾蘇拉大姐，你們家現在真是好找多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是先生爭氣嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃攤主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，他可不光是替自己爭了口氣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃攤主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祝賀你們搬新家，也祝賀車爾尼，以前還是個小鬼，轉眼間就成了大人物，做了件我們想都不敢想的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃攤主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，這房間真明亮……這是什麼，浴缸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃攤主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經好多年沒看過這個東西啦。大姐，這個用起來怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這還用問？以前一到陰雨天，我就覺得骨頭縫裡很癢，難受得不得了。幸好有先生，現在到浴缸裡泡一泡，整個人就好多啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃攤主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，車爾尼，烏爾蘇拉大姐的日子好起來啦，這都是你的功勞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃攤主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給你！這可是高庭區的老爺都喜歡的好酒，為了從那個開咖啡店的傢伙那裡弄到手，我花了一番心思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真是太客氣啦。我們正好要吃飯，要不要留下來一起吃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃攤主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃攤主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前天突然來了一群人，說是來“尋訪大作曲家車爾尼的出身地”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃攤主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好我一邊拉手風琴一邊大喊，油煎酸漬高麗菜攤也總算開張了一回。萬一以後還有這樣的生意，我可不能放過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也好，你快去忙吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，剛剛怎麼啦，別人來祝賀你，怎麼連個招呼也不打一聲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我前一陣子造成別人不小的麻煩，所以就……稍微有點尷尬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩？哦，你說吵架那件事啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早就都過去啦。你已經去跟他道歉了，他也有說，你是關心則亂，他根本沒放在心上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生你不怎麼會說話，夕照區哪個人不知道這件事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我還是要說，你真的太急躁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"范妮小姐吃東西吃不出味道，她是因為病得迷迷糊糊，才以為別人在嫌棄自己，可是你怎麼也跟著那麼容易被激怒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑到小吃攤的時候我都嚇到啦，第一次看到你發那麼大的火——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是我不好。先吃飯，先吃飯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏爾蘇拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，怎麼啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得，我要是去那場葬禮，像大叔剛剛說的那種生意……會多起來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如我揭開自己脆弱的一面，給那些絲毫不關心我們命運的人看，讓他們品頭論足，夕照區……就能多幾間有浴缸的房子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不對。音樂不應該是這樣的，至少我的音樂不應該是這樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g7_concerthall_outside"},{"type":"narration","text":"“因為我知道，不管是我，還是我的音樂，都再也不可能走出這小小的夕照區了。”\n“答應我，不要像我一樣，不要在這件事上輸給我……好嗎？”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g5_czernyhome"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，你要去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去找格特魯德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早一點答應她的邀請，我就能早一點開始把《晨暮》改成鋼琴獨奏曲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g7_concerthall_outside"},{"type":"narration","text":"時間過得飛快。\n上一任斯特羅洛伯爵的葬禮已經進行到一半，演奏即將開始。\n車爾尼抬頭望向遠方，看見的是高庭區高聳的建築，但他想起的是那個陪著范妮一遍又一遍地路過夕照廳的下午。\n他向人群淺淺地一鞠躬，坐下，開始演奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻薄的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"居然讓一個感染者在葬禮上演奏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尖酸的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"難道不只是想藉著哥哥死了的這個機會，多賣幾張唱片而已嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g7_concerthall_outside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多嘴的評論家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"鋼琴獨奏？我很懷疑他是不是真的能用一架鋼琴就把長笛和大提琴的氣質同時表現出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的評論家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"音樂家的耳朵很靈敏。他聽得到所有那些在他還沒真正開始演奏，就已充斥著惡意的聲音。\n他懊悔地咬住舌頭，但演奏已經開始了。\n他已經聽見了一切，但他必須讓自己什麼都聽不見。\n旋律在廣場上緩緩流淌，那些吵雜的聲音並未平息，卻也在同時漸漸離他而去。\n晨暮。\n清晨與黃昏。\n如果說長笛清澈、明亮、寬廣，如同山頂一覽無餘的日出，那麼，鋼琴演奏的朝陽，從一開始就被一層薄霧籠罩著。\n陽光一視同仁地灑向大地，不因乾渴而收斂片刻，也不因雲翳而強烈分毫。\n清晨的絲絲寒意，甚至讓人從中感受到某種無情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的評論家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……很大膽的處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多嘴的評論家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我還是覺得不太對。這真的能叫朝陽嗎？這樣的朝陽，到底能照亮什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的評論家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有可能什麼都不能照亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻薄的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他還蠻投入的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尖酸的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在這麼多貴族面前演奏，他這輩子大概也就這一次了，怎麼能不抓緊機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尖酸的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過要我說，斯特羅洛——不是人群裡進進出出那位，是棺材裡躺著的那個，他也真是倒楣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尖酸的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在父親的陰影裡活了那麼多年，剛上台掌權沒多久，就因為一場急病去世，葬禮上表演的還是個感染者。"},{"type":"narration","text":"清晨與黃昏。\n即使在低音區盤桓再久，擊錘也不可能像琴弓那樣，用殘陽血般沉鬱的猩紅震動聽者的心弦。\n因此，他選擇演奏一個看似再尋常不過的夕照。\n太陽要落下了，我們該睡了。\n短促的呼吸聲，床鋪的氣味，天花板上的橘紅，深藍色天幕中隱現的碎星。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g13_afterglow_R2"},{"type":"narration","text":"徹底轉黑的夜將逝者緊緊擁抱，苟延殘喘的光亮仍不肯就此離去，而音樂家將這一切棄之不顧，演奏明暗交接處那一抹顫抖的青綠。\n激烈而平靜、深刻而無謂，再尋常不過的生離死別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尖酸的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"斯特羅洛伯爵，真是的……唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尖酸的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"畏畏縮縮的傢伙，說一句話要賠好幾個笑，就算繼承爵位之後也是一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尖酸的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我最後一次見到他的時候，他帶錯了禮品，我把他好好地嘲笑了一番……可是現在，就好像他還在我眼前笑一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尖酸的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不應該那麼做，真的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻薄的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……噓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尖酸的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（吸鼻子）"},{"type":"narration","text":"清晨與黃昏。\n旭日一路爬升，直到最高的那個點，高到令人幾乎不敢呼吸，然後緩緩下落，直到夕陽沉沉，沒入大地。\n和太陽相比，我們還太渺小，還太脆弱，我們的喜怒哀樂彌足珍貴，卻又微不足道。\n假如我們能在塵世駐留得長一些，再長一些，是否就能看見疼痛被消解，皺紋被撫平，失去的愛在東升的夕陽和西沉的朝日間變得年輕？\n但我們只是受限於時間的渺小生物，我們終將離別。\n一場娓娓道來的離別。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g8_concerthall_outside_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"在場的所有人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"最後一個音符消失在黃昏的風裡。\n直到風將音符吹出維謝海姆，吹向看不見的遠方，竊竊私語聲才重新響了起來。\n相比音樂開始前，這些私語顯得嚴肅而收斂，其間夾雜著低回的啜泣聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻薄的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……你知道我想起誰了嗎？我想起我叔叔了。戰場上退下來的老兵，脾氣很壞，和我也沒太多交集，後來人也糊塗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻薄的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他去世之前有一次，我去拜訪他，剛好看到他在花園裡燒東西。紙灰被風卷起，好像一場從地面下到天上的灰色的雪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尖酸的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"車爾尼，車爾尼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尖酸的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"人的命運真的毫無公平可言，他怎麼會出生在這個地方，怎麼偏偏會是個感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的評論家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不說話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多嘴的評論家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（吸鼻子）我……唉……我還能說什麼？我還配說什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多嘴的評論家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等我回去，等我平靜下來，我會寫一篇溫和的批評。你知道，那就是我最高的讚賞。但現在——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多嘴的評論家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多嘴的評論家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"說點其他的，你看到埃德先生了嗎？他是斯特羅洛女士這次請來的最德高望重的評論家，但是我一直沒看到他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的評論家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"斯特羅洛女士剛才就在葬禮現場找他了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多嘴的評論家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"剛才？車爾尼先生在演奏的時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的評論家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"narration","text":"車爾尼緩緩吐出一口鬱結已久的氣。\n他的耳朵很靈敏。他全都聽見了，那些被成見所困，同時也被藝術……被自己的脆弱打動的聲音。\n他抹了一把臉上的淚水，無意間瞟到了格特魯德的身影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃德先生，您在夕照區的小巷子裡迷路，沒出事真是萬幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德高望重的評論家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還麻煩您把我從那裡帶出來，甚至讓您錯過了車爾尼先生的演奏，我有責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您看您說的。即使在那裡，我們不是也聽見了嗎？多美的音樂啊。"},{"type":"narration","text":"格特魯德在轉過頭之前忘了收起臉上客套的微笑，忘了換上滿臉的哀戚，就那麼和車爾尼視線相接。\n當她發覺音樂家通紅的眼眶與自己的表情多不相稱時，她才意識到，自己犯了個大錯誤。\n但願挽回還來得及，她這麼想著，維持著臉上的笑容，拋下身邊的評論家，快步走上前去。\n正如她所料，車爾尼也朝自己迎面走來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多嘴的評論家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"車爾尼怎麼回事，他沒向觀眾致意，反而直接朝斯特羅洛女士走去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多嘴的評論家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……也對，他們一定有很多話要說吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g13_afterglow_L2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是……你對你哥哥的追悼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……藝術家可以做到絕對的純粹，但贊助人不行。"},{"type":"narration","text":"夕陽西斜，兩人都刻意沒再去看對方的臉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那好，現在輪到你悼念他了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"車爾尼快步離開夕照區的廣場，沒有致意，沒有停留，沒有看任何人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g5_czernyhome"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，你的信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰寄來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……斯特羅洛伯爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們已經一個月沒聯繫了，會不會……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邀請函……和親筆信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還想邀請我第二次嗎，格特魯德……斯特羅洛女士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，先看一下她寫了什麼吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寒暄，問候……無聊透頂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，她在結尾說……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格特魯德，你這個……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邀請函……也不是她自己的，而是……巡演？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巡演？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那場葬禮之後，許多評論家和貴族想讓我去他們的城市演出，於是她乾脆策劃了一個“巡演”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“藝術家可以做到絕對的純粹，但贊助人不行”，是這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏爾蘇拉，關於巡演，你怎麼想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者的巡演……我想不出來會是什麼樣子，但一定不輕鬆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不只不輕鬆而已。大概就和珍奇動物展覽差不多……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我一定要去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是相信自己的琴聲，感染者的琴聲……能夠跨越最遙遠的隔閡，走入那些貴族的心中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算沒有報酬，就算像個珍奇動物一樣被那些人圍觀，只要獸籠中還有一架鋼琴……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算只有一根鐵棍，能讓我敲響鐵籠，我就心甘情願。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"narration","text":"如同車爾尼所料，感染者音樂家的巡演就如同珍奇動物展覽一樣。\n就像現在，在巡演的最後一站……\n為了讓他這個感染者能用自己的雙腳走向演奏會場，街道被清空，沒有人願意和感染者走在一起，除了一個不耐煩的看守。\n忽然，他聽見幾絲極細、極熟悉的樂音，從路旁的花園中傳來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《晨暮》？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要停下來，快點走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，那邊的花園……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是侯爵大人的家族墓地！快走快走！"},{"type":"narration","text":"車爾尼邁開腳步，同時仰頭看向天空。\n城市陰翳的天空幾乎不辨明暗，巡演以來極不規律的作息也讓他晝夜顛倒，隨時都想沉沉睡去。\n他已經快沒力氣了。\n但他還要支撐著這具染病的身軀，再繞著這片名為生活的巨大的天地，一圈又一圈地走下去。\n他將唾棄，將歌頌，將憎恨，將眷戀……\n從清晨，直到黃昏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
